{"id": "e68daeb0-1de5-48a9-b1a0-5d5aea1c57fb", "slug": "enterprise-payment-infrastructure-1", "title": "Enterprise Payment Infrastructure", "description": "Enterprise Payment Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Enterprise Payment Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Enterprise Payment Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#38BDF8\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#10B981\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#191C21\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#333333\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Enterprise Payment Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 12; favorites: 2; remixes: 2.\nTags: pricing, section, billing, cta, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nEnterprise Payment Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nNexusPay Platform Solutions Developers Pricing Connected to 40+ Gateways Enterprise-Grade Payment Infrastructure Simplified. Automate reconciliations, route transactions dynamically, and scale your global revenue operat…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Enterprise-Grade Payment Infrastructure Simplified..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #38BDF8, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #10B981, background #FFFFFF, surface #191C21, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Enterprise Payment Infrastructure</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                        mono: ['JetBrains Mono', 'monospace'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        dark: '#050505',\n                        brand: {\n                            400: '#34d399', // Emerald 400\n                            500: '#10b981', // Emerald 500\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Base specific styles */\n        body {\n            background-color: #050505;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* Dot matrix background texture for the left panel */\n        .bg-dots-pattern {\n            background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 14px 14px;\n        }\n\n        /* Landscape blur simulation */\n        .landscape-blur {\n            background:\n                radial-gradient(circle at 70% 80%, #166534 0%, transparent 60%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 20% 90%, #22c55e 0%, transparent 60%),\n                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 10%, #38bdf8 0%, transparent 70%),\n                linear-gradient(180deg, #7dd3fc 0%, #e0f2fe 40%, #86efac 60%, #14532d 100%);\n            filter: blur(50px);\n            transform: scale(1.2); /* Hide blurred edges */\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Scrollbar */\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n            width: 8px;\n            height: 8px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n            background: #050505;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n            background: #333;\n            border-radius: 4px;\n        }\n        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n            background: #555;\n        }\n\n        /* Gradient Border Wrapper Utility */\n        .gradient-border-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-wrapper::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: -1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n            padding: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.4) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 100%);\n            -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col lg:flex-row selection:bg-brand-500/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Container Lines & Mini Squares Skill Implementation -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 overflow-hidden flex justify-between px-[5%] lg:px-[15%] opacity-30 mix-blend-overlay\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.05] relative\">\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[15%] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-dark\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[85%] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-dark\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.05] relative hidden md:block\">\n             <div class=\"absolute top-[45%] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-dark\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-white/[0.05] relative\">\n             <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-dark\"></div>\n             <div class=\"absolute top-[70%] -left-[3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/20 bg-dark\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Left Panel: Content -->\n    <main class=\"w-full lg:w-[48%] relative flex flex-col min-h-[100svh] p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-14 xl:p-20 z-10 bg-dark bg-dots-pattern\">\n\n        <!-- Subtle radial gradient overlay for focus -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-radial-gradient from-transparent via-dark/50 to-dark pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 50%, transparent 0%, #050505 80%);\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Header / Nav -->\n        <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full relative z-20 mb-16 lg:mb-0\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-white text-dark flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:infinity-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"font-medium tracking-tight text-lg\">NexusPay</span>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-zinc-400 font-medium\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Developers</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n            </nav>\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-zinc-400 hover:text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" class=\"text-2xl\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Hero Content -->\n        <div class=\"flex-grow flex flex-col justify-center max-w-xl relative z-20\">\n\n            <!-- Glowing Badge -->\n            <div class=\"relative inline-flex mb-8 self-start group cursor-pointer\">\n                <div class=\"absolute w-[130%] h-[160%] top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-brand-500 blur-[30px] opacity-20 rounded-full group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"relative bg-white text-dark rounded-full py-1.5 px-3 flex items-center gap-2.5 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-dark rounded-full w-5 h-5 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                         <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bolt-linear\" class=\"text-brand-400 text-[10px]\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.15em] pr-2 text-dark/90 mt-[1px]\">Connected to 40+ Gateways</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Headline -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl xl:text-[4rem] leading-[1.05] tracking-tight font-medium text-white mb-6\">\n                <!-- Using inline blocks for GSAP staggered mask reveal -->\n                <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-2\"><span class=\"inline-block word-inner translate-y-[110%] pb-1\">Enterprise-Grade</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-2\"><span class=\"inline-block word-inner translate-y-[110%] pb-1\">Payment</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-2\"><span class=\"inline-block word-inner translate-y-[110%] pb-1\">Infrastructure</span></span>\n                <span class=\"inline-block overflow-hidden align-bottom mr-2\"><span class=\"inline-block word-inner translate-y-[110%] pb-1 text-brand-400\">Simplified.</span></span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <p class=\"text-zinc-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-md font-light\">\n                Automate reconciliations, route transactions dynamically, and scale your global revenue operations with a single unified API.\n            </p>\n\n            <!-- Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-white text-dark hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1),0px_1px_0px_0px_rgba(25,28,33,0.02),0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(25,28,33,0.08)]\">\n                    Start Integration\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-base\"></iconify-icon>\n                </a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"w-full sm:w-auto bg-white/[0.03] hover:bg-white/[0.08] border border-white/10 text-white transition-colors rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium\">\n                    Read the Docs\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer Logos -->\n        <div class=\"mt-16 lg:mt-auto relative z-20 pt-8 flex flex-col gap-4\">\n            <span class=\"text-zinc-500 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest\">Seamlessly integrates with</span>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-8 gap-y-4 text-zinc-400/60 grayscale contrast-200\">\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm tracking-tight hover:text-white hover:grayscale-0 transition-all cursor-default\">Stripe</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm tracking-tight hover:text-white hover:grayscale-0 transition-all cursor-default\">Braintree</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm tracking-tight hover:text-white hover:grayscale-0 transition-all cursor-default\">Adyen</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm tracking-tight hover:text-white hover:grayscale-0 transition-all cursor-default\">Paddle</span>\n                <span class=\"font-semibold text-sm tracking-tight hover:text-white hover:grayscale-0 transition-all cursor-default\">PayPal</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Right Panel: Visuals & Interactive Elements -->\n    <aside class=\"w-full lg:w-[52%] h-[60vh] lg:h-screen p-4 sm:p-6 lg:p-8 lg:pl-0 relative z-20 interactive-container\">\n        <!-- Main Graphic Container with Border Gradient -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full rounded-[2rem] lg:rounded-[2.5rem] bg-zinc-900 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] gradient-border-wrapper overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center\">\n\n            <!-- Blurred Landscape Background -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 landscape-blur bg-layer\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Vignette overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-radial-gradient from-transparent via-transparent to-black/30 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Code Snippet Card -->\n            <!-- Beautiful lg shadow applied -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 w-[90%] max-w-[420px] bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)] border border-white/40 floating-element-1 transform-gpu\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <pre class=\"font-mono text-[11px] sm:text-xs text-slate-700 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre-wrap\">\n<span class=\"text-slate-400\">// Initialize transaction routing</span>\n<span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">export async function</span> <span class=\"text-blue-600\">processPayment</span>(payload) {\n  <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">if</span> (!payload.amount) {\n    <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">throw new</span> <span class=\"text-amber-600\">Error</span>(<span class=\"text-emerald-600\">'Amount required'</span>);\n  }\n\n  <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">const</span> route = <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">await</span> router.optimize({\n    <span class=\"text-slate-500\">currency</span>: payload.currency,\n    <span class=\"text-slate-500\">region</span>: payload.userRegion\n  });\n\n  <span class=\"text-purple-600 font-medium\">return</span> gateway.charge({\n    ...payload,\n    <span class=\"text-slate-500\">providerId</span>: route.id\n  });\n}</pre>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Floating Dark Status Pill -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-[100px] sm:translate-y-[120px] w-max bg-dark/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 rounded-full py-2.5 px-5 flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 shadow-[0px_0px_0px_1px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_1px_1px_-0.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_3px_3px_-1.5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),_0px_6px_6px_-3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_12px_12px_-6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06),0px_24px_24px_-12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.06)] floating-element-2 transform-gpu\">\n                 <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magic-stick-3-linear\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                 <span class=\"text-zinc-200 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide\">Optimizing route in real-time</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Custom Horizontal Pagination Dots -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-20 bottom-8 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 flex gap-2 items-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white/30 rounded-full cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/60 transition-colors\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-white rounded-full cursor-pointer shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)]\"></div>\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-white/30 rounded-full cursor-pointer hover:bg-white/60 transition-colors\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n    <script>\n        // Wait for DOM to load\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n\n            // 1. GSAP Masked Reveal for Headline\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            gsap.to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.1,\n                ease: \"power4.out\",\n                delay: 0.2 // slight delay on load\n            });\n\n            // 2. WebGL-like Parallax Interactivity on Mouse Move\n            const container = document.querySelector('.interactive-container');\n            const bgLayer = document.querySelector('.bg-layer');\n            const float1 = document.querySelector('.floating-element-1');\n            const float2 = document.querySelector('.floating-element-2');\n\n            if(container && window.innerWidth > 1024) { // Only enable parallax on larger screens\n                container.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = e.clientX - rect.left;\n                    const y = e.clientY - rect.top;\n\n                    // Calculate normalized coordinates (-1 to 1)\n                    const xNorm = (x / rect.width - 0.5) * 2;\n                    const yNorm = (y / rect.height - 0.5) * 2;\n\n                    // Apply subtle transforms to create depth\n                    gsap.to(bgLayer, {\n                        x: xNorm * -15,\n                        y: yNorm * -15,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n\n                    gsap.to(float1, {\n                        x: xNorm * 25,\n                        y: yNorm * 25,\n                        rotationY: xNorm * 4,\n                        rotationX: yNorm * -4,\n                        duration: 1,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n\n                    gsap.to(float2, {\n                        x: '-50%', // Maintain horizontal centering base\n                        xPercent: xNorm * 40, // Add percentage based movement\n                        y: yNorm * 40,\n                        duration: 1.2,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n                });\n\n                // Reset positions on mouse leave\n                container.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    gsap.to([bgLayer, float1], {\n                        x: 0,\n                        y: 0,\n                        rotationY: 0,\n                        rotationX: 0,\n                        duration: 1.5,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.5)\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n\n                    gsap.to(float2, {\n                        x: '-50%',\n                        xPercent: 0,\n                        y: 0,\n                        duration: 1.5,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.5)\",\n                        overwrite: \"auto\"\n                    });\n                });\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "enterprise-payment-infrastructure-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/enterprise-payment-infrastructure-1.jpg", "source_name": "enterprise-payment-infrastructure-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 81, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-04-29T09:15:30.794547+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T13:49:17.212308+00:00"}